  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The cloth of this banner has been cut by a thousand blades and shows no mend. It stirs when there is no wind, and soldiers say it leans toward whichever side of a field is losing heart.</p><p><strong>Raise the Banner.</strong> As an action, you plant the banner. While it stands, you and your allies within 30 feet of it cannot have the Frightened condition and gain [[/heal 10 type=temphp]] at the start of each of your turns. It stands until you take it up again or it is knocked down (AC 15, 50 Hit Points, restored each dawn).</p><p><strong>True Colors.</strong> The banner shows the device of whatever cause its bearer truly believes in, not the one they claim. Anyone who sees it knows at once whether the bearer is sincere, and an army that marches under a false device watches it turn blank.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
